# ---------------------------------------------------------------- data
# TRACKED ON PURPOSE. The deployed dashboard reads these files and must not
# need a rebuild, and committing them makes every published number
# reproducible from the repository alone. All are small:
#   data/raw/source/*.csv     official government files, untouched  (~4.2 MB)
#   data/raw/*.csv            Rajasthan subset, derived by a script   (~195 KB)
#   data/interim/clean.parquet, data/processed/features.parquet       (small)
#   outputs/**/*.csv          pipeline results, incl. outputs/legacy/
# Their SHA-256 hashes are recorded in docs/RUN_MANIFEST.md.
#
# Fitted model objects are NOT tracked: the app does not load them, and a
# pickled model is opaque and version-fragile.
models_store/*
!models_store/.gitkeep

# Current-price snapshots fetched with a personal data.gov.in API key.
# Regenerable with scripts/fetch_current_prices.py; not part of the evaluation.
data/live/
